<title>USA: Symbol Technologies names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Symbol Technologies names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOLTSVILLE, N.Y. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Symbol Technologies Inc said on Monday it named Kenneth Jaeggi senior vice president and chief financial officer, succeeding Thomas Amato.</p>
<p>Amato resigned to accept a position with another company, the company said.</p>
<p>Jaeggi was most recently a member of the four-person office of the chairman and head of the operating committee of Electromagnetic Sciences Inc.</p>
